OL,3,GNEWSAGlobal Microsoft outage hits
OL,4,Aschools, doctors and businesses as
OL,5,Acompany scrambles to solve issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Microsoft outage, which has been
OL,8,Fgoing for at least 20 hours, is
OL,9,Faffecting services including Teams,
OL,10,FOutlook and AI software Copilot -
OL,11,Fhere's what we know
OL,13,FMicrosoft says it is seeing "continued
OL,14,Frecovery progress across affected
OL,15,Fregions" including Europe and North
OL,16,FAmerica ` but some users may still have
OL,17,F"access issues".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
